// Syncthing ignore patterns for train/checkpoints/ (distributed league
// training — docs/distributed_league_training.md). league_worker.py copies
// this file to train/checkpoints/.stignore on startup if absent (the dir is
// gitignored, so the template lives here in scripts/).
//
// Never replicate atomic-write intermediates: both train.py's sidecar writes
// and the worker/dashboard coordination files write foo.json.tmp then
// os.replace(). Replicating a .tmp could ship a partial file.
*.tmp
// TensorBoard logs are local-only (LOG_DIR is cwd-relative and shouldn't land
// here anyway — defensive).
logs
// Everything else syncs: {deck}__v*.zip / {deck}__final.zip snapshots, the
// _league_progress*.json sidecars, and the _worker_status*/_control* files
// (the dashboard's status + control transport — do NOT ignore those).
